{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"置换范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"置换范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>置换范畴, 又称"},{"Local":{"url":"严格1-范畴","text":"严格"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", 其中严格是指结合律与幺元律严格成立.</p>\n<p>置换范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"严格1-范畴","text":"严格 $1$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 $1\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\mathrm{str}}$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"严格幺半范畴","text":"严格幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}